# TET-Match-Profil (TET Navigator): folgt vorgegebenen Wegpunkten auf jedem Weg,
# nur zum Ermitteln der OSM-Belag-Tags entlang eines Tracks (keine Navigation).
---context:global
assign processUnusedTags = true
assign validForBikes 1
assign validForCars 1
assign validForFoot 1
assign turnInstructionMode = 0
assign downhillcost 0
assign downhillcutoff 0
assign uphillcost 0
assign uphillcutoff 0

---context:way
assign dummyUsage = and surface= and tracktype= smoothness=
assign turncost 0
assign initialclassifier 0
assign initialcost 0
assign costfactor switch highway= 10000 1

---context:node
assign initialcost 0
